#: includes/mcp/class-trackship-abilities.php:234
msgid ""
"Add, replace or clear the internal note on one shipment (shown in the "
"Shipment notes column of the TrackShip Shipments page; never sent to the "
"customer). Identify the shipment by \"shipment_id\", or by \"order_id\" plus "
"\"tracking_number\" when the order has more than one shipment. \"note\" "
"replaces the existing note; an empty string clears it. Max 1000 characters. "
"To read notes use get-shipment or list-shipments, which return shipment_id "
"and shipment_note. Confirm the wording with the user first."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot, aizstāt vai notīrīt iekšējo piezīmi vienam sūtījumam (redzama "
"TrackShip sūtījumu lapas kolonnā “Sūtījuma piezīmes”; nekad netiek nosūtīta "
"klientam). Identificēt sūtījumu pēc “shipment_id” vai pēc “order_id” plus "
"“tracking_number”, ja pasūtījumam ir vairāk nekā viens sūtījums. “note” "
"aizstāj esošo piezīmi; tukša virkne to notīra. Maks. 1000 rakstzīmes. Lai "
"lasītu piezīmes, izmantojiet get-shipment vai list-shipments, kas atgriež "
"shipment_id un shipment_note. Vispirms apstipriniet formulējumu ar lietotāju."

#: includes/mcp/class-trackship-abilities.php:206
msgid ""
"Add/update or remove shipping carrier mappings. \"set\" is a map of detected "
"provider name => TrackShip provider slug (ts_slug); \"remove\" is a list of "
"detected provider names to delete. Each ts_slug is validated against the "
"known TrackShip provider list; unknown slugs are skipped. This changes store "
"configuration — confirm with the user first."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot/atjaunināt vai noņemt piegādes pārvadātāja kartējumus. \"set\" ir "
"noteiktā pakalpojumu sniedzēja nosaukuma karte => TrackShip pakalpojumu "
"sniedzēja slug (ts_slug); \"remove\" ir noteikto pakalpojumu sniedzēju "
"nosaukumu saraksts, kas jādzēš. Katrs ts_slug tiek pārbaudīts, salīdzinot ar "
"zināmo TrackShip pakalpojumu sniedzēju sarakstu; nezināmas slug tiek "
"izlaistas. Tas maina veikala konfigurāciju — vispirms apstipriniet ar "
"lietotāju."

